\details{
There are several main functoins. \code{Decision_rule_S_1stage}, \code{Decision_rule_M_1stage}, \code{Decision_rule_W_1stage}, \code{ruleF}, and \code{ruleFS} determine the decision rule for clinical trials. \code{op.1stage}, \code{op.F}, and \code{op.FS} calculate the operating characteristics for clinical trial designs, including type I error, power, and expected sample size, to investigate the performance of the designs. 
}
